    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "tree_body",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 252,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "VeilidConfig\n├── program_name · namespace · capabilities { disable: [] }\n├── network\n│   ├── max_connections · network_key_password (→ private network)\n│   ├── routing_table { public_keys, secret_keys, bootstrap, bootstrap_keys [3 Ed25519] }\n│   ├── rpc { default_route_hop_count: 1 }  ·  dht { local/remote cache sizes, storage caps }\n│   ├── protocol { udp { enabled, listen }, tcp { connect, listen }, ws { connect, listen, path }, wss }\n│   ├── privacy { require_inbound_relay }  ·  tls { cert_path, key_path, initial_timeout }\n│   └── address_types [] · upnp: true · detect_address_changes: true\n├── protected_store { allow_insecure_fallback, device_encryption_key_password }\n├── table_store { directory, max_value_size_mb: 64 }  ·  block_store { directory }\n└── internal (footgun-config feature) { network.rpc.*, network.dht.*, network.protocol.* }",
      "originalText": "VeilidConfig\n├── program_name · namespace · capabilities { disable: [] }\n├── network\n│   ├── max_connections · network_key_password (→ private network)\n│   ├── routing_table { public_keys, secret_keys, bootstrap, bootstrap_keys [3 Ed25519] }\n│   ├── rpc { default_route_hop_count: 1 }  ·  dht { local/remote cache sizes, storage caps }\n│   ├── protocol { udp { enabled, listen }, tcp { connect, listen }, ws { connect, listen, path }, wss }\n│   ├── privacy { require_inbound_relay }  ·  tls { cert_path, key_path, initial_timeout }\n│   └── address_types [] · upnp: true · detect_address_changes: true\n├── protected_store { allow_insecure_fallback, device_encryption_key_password }\n├── table_store { directory, max_value_size_mb: 64 }  ·  block_store { directory }\n└── internal (footgun-config feature) { network.rpc.*, network.dht.*, network.protocol.* }",
      "fontSize": 9,
