      "height": 78,
      "text": "validate() enforces:\n  program_name non-empty · max_connections in range · hop_count 1-5\n  consensus_width ≥ set_value_count · get_value_count ≥ set_value_count/2\n  get/set_value_timeout ≥ 2 × rpc.timeout · max_watch_exp ≥ 2 × rpc.timeout\n  rpc.queue_size ≥ 256 · rpc.timeout ≥ 1000ms\n  WSS url required when wss.listen enabled",
